    "title": "Fingerhut Mobile",
    "description": "The Fingerhut mobile app is the easiest way to stay connected with us wherever you go.\r\n\r\nSign in with your existing Fingerhut.com username and password, or you can use your fingerprint or a 4-Digit PIN.\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s a short list of what you can do once you\u2019re signed in:\r\n\u2022 Shop top brands and products with low monthly payments*\r\n\u2022 See your available credit and current balance\r\n\u2022 Track your latest orders\r\n\u2022 Make payments on Fingerhut Fetti, Advantage, or FreshStart credit accounts\r\n\u2022 Setup and view recurring payment schedules\r\n\u2022 See past orders and payments\r\n\u2022 Check out special deals and promotions\r\n\u2022 Enable push notifications to get payment reminders and more\r\n\r\n* If you apply and are accepted for a Fingerhut Credit Account issued by WebBank, Member FDIC, who determines eligibility and qualifications for the terms of credit.",
